      "content": "it's just not about small steps anymore. i've tried everything. every time i try to \"be visible\" i just hit another wall, another person telling me it's not their problem or that i'm doing it wrong. it's like the more i struggle, the harder the system pushes back. it feels like the only way to actually win is to stop playing the game entirely. like there's no way to exist in a world that's designed to just grind you down until there's nothing left.",
